  "description": "Angham is a smooth and luxurious fragrance that blends warm spices, creamy vanilla, and rich amber woods into a refined gourmand-inspired scent. The fragrance feels elegant, cozy, and modern with a balance of sweetness and aromatic depth. The opening introduces ginger, mandarin, and pink pepper, creating a fresh spicy brightness with a warm energetic character. The heart develops into praline, lavender, cacao, and jasmine, adding creamy sweetness balanced by soft florals and aromatic nuances. The base settles into vanilla, amber, musk, and sandalwood, leaving a warm, smooth, and long-lasting trail that feels addictive, comforting, and sophisticated. Angham is perfect for those who enjoy warm vanilla fragrances with spicy sweetness and a luxurious amber dry-down.",
